we literally just got the biggest iphone  14 lineup leak that confirms a lot of  the leaks and rumors and speculations  over the past couple of months but  before i show you guys this new photo of  the iphone 14 lineup i want to mention  that a lot of people are already  disappointed they are saying that it's  ugly and they can't believe apple is  doing this but i want to make it clear  that i completely disagree and i think  everybody is wrong but before i get into  that photo i want to refresh you guys of  the renders that i created with renders  by shy lesh and as you can see we have  this dual hole punch cut out and the  current large rear camera bump which is  going to be getting even bigger this  year as you can see these are some  pretty sick  renders but jumping right into this  photo from a source that was leaked on  weibo as you can see we have the  official iphone  14 lineup display  panels now this is a really big deal  because it confirms the exact situation  with the bezels the dual hole punch  cutout the thinner earpiece speaker and  much more but before i dig deep into all  of those details i want to prove to you  guys why i believe this is completely  legit now first of all john prosser from  front page tech was actually the first  one who reported this on youtube but he  says it is ugly and he can't believe  that apple is doing this but once again  i disagree with them and all over the  internet like on the mac rumors post  comments a lot of people are saying this  looks horrible the notch is cleaner i  hate to say it but i like the notch  better and a lot of other people are  disappointed with this design but i  think they are all  wrong and even a lot of people on  twitter are saying that it looks ugly  and even worse than the notch and i  completely disagree and i will explain  why in just a minute but before i get  into all of that i want to confirm why i  think this leak is completely legit well  first of all john prosser confirmed with  shrimp apple pro and he said that yes  this is exactly what we should be  expecting and the reason this is a big  deal is because shrimp apple pro was  actually the first source that leaked  the dual hole punch cutout and he was  correct and he was even vouched for by  mark german and ross young who are the  most reliable analysts currently right  now and the most interesting part is  that he gave us an exclusive leak back  on january 7th saying that the regular  iphone 14 and 14 max models are gonna  have a refined  notch and what he showed right here is  that the notch will now be more rounded  on this inside edge which is exactly  what he was saying and these new display  panel leaks confirm it and the awesome  thing is that shrimp apple pro also  confirmed the leaks of these iphone 14  lineup molds as you can see these molds  show off the differences in the camera  bumps and these bumps are massive and  you can even see that the actual lenses  themselves are wider and larger on the  pro models compared to the max models  and that's a very important detail  because  mixture quo and other sources have  confirmed that the new main camera on  the pro models will be 42 mega pixels  which is why they're getting larger and  now we also got these plastic 3d printed  mock-ups for case manufacturers to base  them off of and they also match up to  all of these leaks including these ones  right here now this is important because  i want to take you back to the iphone 13  lineup leaks yes way back in march of  2021 we got very similar display panel  leaks and in the beginning some people  were doubting them but they ended up  being exactly what we got on the iphone  13 lineup as you can see the smaller  notch with the relocated earpiece  speaker which we got on the iphone 13  lineup and dan roy back in april of last  year he even showed off these new  display panels and of course they were  perfectly legit and this is a big deal  because  it's april right now and those leaks  happened in april so this really matches  up perfectly now as far as these  aluminum printed molds i also think that  they are legit because if you go back to  last year back in july we also had these  dummy models created and leaked and this  is exactly what we got with the iphone  13 model so this was legit as well  and we also got these ones which are  actually aluminum showing off more  detail in terms of the camera bumps and  finally here is the last piece of  evidence for why i think these display  panels are legit yes mark german just  retweeted them saying that this is the  best look yet at the new pro cutout so  he completely agrees that these are  legitimate and now with that said let me  answer the question of why everybody is  wrong about the dual hole punch camera  looking worse than the notch well first  of all greg's gadget made a very good  point when he showed what everybody  thought about the leaked iphone 4 design  as you can see people are saying that it  looks hideous short answer no it looks  horrendous fake ugly no way however  people loved the iphone 4 design after  it actually came out and it was in  people's hands and i think the exact  same thing is gonna happen this time  around in september when they finally  launch people start using them people  start experiencing the screen real  estate difference they're gonna love  that apple made this change to the pro  models and as you can see right here it  shows a huge difference between the  regular iphone 14s and the pro models  first of all you can see a clear  difference in the bezels and you get a  lot of extra screen real estate in this  area so it actually looks very very nice  now if i actually pull up the display  leak itself we can get a close-up of  these differences as you can see the  bezels are now 20  thinner than on the regular 13 and 14  models which are unchanged and if you  look at that earpiece speaker it's now  getting wider and three times slimmer so  it's almost unnoticeable but look at  this entire section of notch which is  now going away you have this extra  screen real estate in between the two  cutouts and above and the really big  point that i want to make clear to you  guys is the only reason we're able to  get thinner bezels reduced by 20  is because apple chose to go with the  dual hole punch design as you can see  the cameras and face id system is  actually moved down  so there's extra space on the inside for  the extra screen up at the top so  because they moved it down you get the  extra screen space and they could not do  that if the notch was still around  because it would get lower and it would  look like the pixel  notch which is absolutely horrible but  moving on to these images you can see a  huge difference in screen real estate i  mean this looks great and this is on the  pro model the smaller one this is not on  the max model and finally this image  probably shows it off the best shared by  shrimp apple pro as you can see look at  all of the extra screen real estate and  i think that's totally worth any people  who are doubting the dual hull punch  design i think it's going to look great  and now if you're still doubting why  apple would make this decision to move  the cameras down and give us the dual  hole punch cutout well we got a pretty  awesome leak from ming cha quo saying  that the front camera of the four new  iphone 14 models is going to have an  upgraded selfie camera with auto focus  and  faster aperture f 1.9 compared to the  fixed focus f 2.2 so we are getting a  better selfie camera this time around  and that is awesome and as far as the  rear camera once again mark german  agrees that we're getting 48 megapixels  on the pro model so apple is really  trying to differentiate the max models  the 14 and the 14 max compared to the  pro and the pro max and really trying to  upsell it and then finally the last  detail i want to share is that the new  color we're getting for the iphone 14  pro is a new darker purple which is  unfortunate because i didn't really like  the sierra blue and i wish we would get  this new bronze because i mean look at  it it looks beautiful but with that said  if you totally disagree with my thoughts  on the new dual hole punch camera  looking great and all those people being  wrong about it then let me know down in  the comment section below but if you  enjoyed the video click the circle above  to subscribe and check out one of those  two right over there thanks for watching  and we'll see you in the next video  [Music]

